{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"「武道館に来る人、期待してください。\nアンダーライブをワンダーライブにしてみせます。\n北野日奈子です。」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！9回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もこもこさんから頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダジャレになっててかわいい！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"弥の明後日後にアンダーライブ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実感が湧かない。がんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/14/2068793/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/14/2068793/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BOMB発売中です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/14/2068793/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝から、忘れ物が多くて\n焦ってばかりの1日だったな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は落ち着いて\n確認して過ごさないと！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！そうだ！\n届いたプレゼント今日頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お家にすぐに持って帰って\n家族に見せびらかしたよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも、そうなんだ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもすぐに持って帰って\n家に着いた瞬間\n皆さんからのプレゼントを\n全部家族に自慢して\n全部家にひろげてみせるの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりプレゼントって嬉しいよね！\n開ける前のワクワクがたまらない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから、クリスマスだし\nクリスマスはプレゼント交換とかあるからメンバー同士でプレゼント交換とかしたら楽しそう！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹にクリスマスプレゼントあげようかな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにがいいんだろー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チップにもクリスマスケーキをプレゼントしよっと♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しろみときみにはどうしようかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"妹とチップとしろみときみに\nクリスマスプレゼントあげたら\nお父さんとお母さんとお兄ちゃんにも\nあげたくなっちゃうな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年はひなサンタになっちゃおうかな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へへへ(｡-∀-｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしそう～(｡-∀-｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/14/2068793/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/14/2068793/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よそみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/14/2068793/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しないで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/14/2068793/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/14/2068793/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆のんちゃんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ブログ＆モバメありがと！\n近いモバメ髪の毛1本だけなんかくねくねしてたよww"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎いま確認するのにみてみたら、本当だった！笑\nチップの毛だ！！！写真撮る直前までチップに顔から埋もれてた(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆あの係木村さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんはポテトチップス何味派ですか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"俺はロイズのポテトチップチョコレートが好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎私もポテトチップチョコレートすきー！その中でも、フロマージュブランが1番すき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆なちくそさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁最近めっきり寒くなってきましたね。\nうちの犬は寒いので散歩に行きたがりません。チップちゃんは寒さ大丈夫ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎チップは、寒くてもお外に出たがりますが、家にはいるとすぐに床暖の上にダイビングして、クッションとかの下に顔を自分で突っ込みにいきます！\nかわいいよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆あっちさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁温泉にも炭酸風呂あったよ\n何か、シュワシュワするよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎前に温泉でみり愛と炭酸風呂に2人ではいりました(｡・・｡)他にもいろいろなお風呂にはいった！みり愛とお風呂はすっごい楽しいんだよ！笑\n笑いが止まらない！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆一般人さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁Ｑ.ゆで卵派？温泉卵派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Ａ.どんな姿形になろうとも\nキミを好きな気持ちに\n変わりはない！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎なんか、ごめんなさい。。。ゆで卵も温泉卵も卵には変わりないですもんね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じ卵なのに、比べたりなんかしちゃってごめんね卵さん。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんな姿形になろうとも\n君を好きな気持ちに\n変わりはない！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆マスオさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁入浴剤は良く使うけどゆずの入浴剤に\n本物の、ゆずを浮かべて入浴すると\n本当にリラックス出来るよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎うわー！なんか聞いただけで良さそうなのが伝わる！やってみます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆棚からよもぎ餅さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁固形入浴剤をお湯に入れたとき段々と小さくなっていくその姿に切なくなるのは、何あるあるですか？Max100あるあるでお願いします！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎ででん！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずばり！75あるあるー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ガチロリ君さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁質問です！寿司屋に行ったら\n何から食べますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎まぐろ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆もってぃーさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ボンバーイーのとき、雑誌破りに何分くらいかかったのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎どのくらいかかったんだろう！\nでも、表紙を隠すのにいつもガムテープをはってるんだけど、ボンバーイーの時はステージ上で使う超強力なガムテープで、めっちゃ苦戦しました！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆じすたさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁100m走の自己ベストは何秒？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎13.6秒！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆たくさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁自分が本当に存在するのか、疑ったことはありますか？意識とはなんなのか考えたことはありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎自分が存在するのか疑ったことはありませんが、いまここにいるこの世界はどうなってるのかとか、そういうことは考えたことあります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆せーだいさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんはオバケとか幽霊の存在信じてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎信じてるよ！お化けも幽霊も、妖怪も宇宙人も信じてる！最近、CGで出てくるようなものすんごい大きい熊とかイノシシとか出てきてるし絶対いるとおもう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆てっつんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きぃちゃんスマブラやったことある？？\nあるとしたら何のキャラよく使う？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎メタナイト一択！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/14/2068793/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで、今日のヒナコセレクト(仮)は以上で終了でーーーす！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだヒナコセレクト募集してまーす！\nどんな質問や話でも大丈夫です！\n皆さんからのコメントの中から\nヒナコがセレクトして紹介します！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/14/2068793/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の2月の！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/14/2068793/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織と話したい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/14/2068793/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで今日はこのへんで！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n4回目はあの係木村さんからです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「家に着くまでが遠足と申しますが、\nこれを読んでるそこのみなさん、\nコメント書くまでがブログですよー。\n今日もありがとう、おやすみなさい。」"}],"source":"archive"}